{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》預定11月首播，主角陳展鵬與姚子羚率先接下12月中旬於美國洛杉磯舉辦商演演唱會。然而消息 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》預定11月首播，主角陳展鵬與姚子羚率先接下12月中旬於美國洛杉磯舉辦商演演唱會。然而消息曝光後，大眾焦點並未落在劇集宣傳之上，反而被高達98美元入場費及獨特海報設計騎劫。這場海外演出未正式舉行便在網上掀起前所未見激烈反彈。</p>\n<h2>陳展鵬姚子羚赴洛杉磯宣傳《玫瑰戰爭》</h2>\n<p>視帝陳展鵬與姚子羚主演的無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》尚未首播，便率先獲邀於12月中遠赴美國洛杉磯舉辦名為《聖誕展翅．羚距離》的演唱會，本是喜事一樁，豈料個唱名字剛曝光就引來大批網民瘋狂吐槽。大眾紛紛直指劇組與主辦單位採用的「展翅羚距離」諧音命名極度老土兼尷尬，更有搞笑網民直接搬出同音的樂壇天后彭羚作對比，笑言「彭羚唱得好過佢哋多多聲」，令這場美騷未開唱先聲奪人。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179325946564561873_14483582676ae2f7c9d5890.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"870245988_18117500144599938_698125740767216235_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179325946564561873_14483582676ae2f7c9d5890.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179325946638830647_9371324486ae2f7ca9d277.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261029100106082-1029_00862_001_02b.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179325946638830647_9371324486ae2f7ca9d277.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>造型衣著慘遭毒舌殘害 濃烈「亞味」被嘲好深圳</h2>\n<p>除了演唱會名稱成為笑柄，兩人曝光的宣傳照與造型亦淪為網民重點開火目標。留言區內一片「亞視味濃」的叫囂聲，甚至有網民狠批兩人的衣著品味「真係好深圳」，滿屏皆是「永恆亞視」與「一陣亞視味」的酸辣嘲諷，指二人即使頂著無綫台慶劇男女主角的光環，卻依然散發出洗不掉的昔日亞視風情，場面相當搞笑。</p>\n<h2>姚子羚跨界開騷遭質疑 「表哥」唱功慘被全網圍攻</h2>\n<p>除了陳展鵬被指尚算有歌藝底子之外，姚子羚以歌手身份登上美國舞台更是引爆全網大號問號，網民紛紛發問「姚子羚有唱歌嘅咩」，更瘋狂重提其經典網絡迷因「表哥」，留言大笑「表哥都開演唱會」、「表哥的剪pan」等爆笑梗。大家對於子羚今次跨界開騷雖然深感驚訝，但也坦言這對螢幕CP的奇幻組合確實充滿獵奇話題性。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932594672197021_3892320156ae2f7cb5d59d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"中國 田徑女神 網民不禁笑指吳艷妮雙眼「好似表哥姚子羚」（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932594672197021_3892320156ae2f7cb5d59d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網民不禁笑指吳艷妮雙眼「好似表哥姚子羚」（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>門票索價98美金被嫌貴 網民無情狠酸「你好意思收錢」</h2>\n<p>最令網民群情洶湧的莫過於門票定價問題，有消息指演唱會門票要價98美元，即時惹來網民極力反彈與狂轟，直言「你哋好意思收錢，仲要收$98咁貴」。留言區隨即被「好尷尬」、「咁墮嘅」等毒舌評論洗版，認為二人既非專業歌手，如此票價實屬誇張，全場抽水氣氛推至最高點，成為今次宣傳中最具話題性的毒舌焦點。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/photo_6159150293112179540_y_40259751868aeca4273669-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：IG@tvb77atelier）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/photo_6159150293112179540_y_40259751868aeca4273669-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@tvb77atelier）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/photo_6159150293112179546_y_67901565068aeca49d1891.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭 楊茜堯 （圖片來源：IG@tvb77atelier）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/photo_6159150293112179546_y_67901565068aeca49d1891.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@tvb77atelier）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a7%9a%e5%ad%90%e7%be%9a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">姚子羚</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%b1%95%e9%b5%ac/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳展鵬</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3532132\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 29 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:21:58.953493+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1302,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:37:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:53.395567+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:18:43.611407+00:00","content_hash":"df2228beaca23e2f8d9a3595ecc8e4c29a0d570a7fbfc55712bc635dba27b850","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}